cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CuHalide Atlas, cite the versioned resource, include the access date, and consult ERRATA.md / the public known-errata metadata."
title: "CuHalide Atlas"
version: "3.0.1"
date-released: "2026-08-10"
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "CuHalide Atlas Project"
url: "https://cuhalide-atlas-v3.vercel.app/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/zion0321/CuHalide-Atlas"
abstract: >-
  Evidence-first, structure-resolved literature database and scientific
  retrieval system for organic-containing Cu(I) chlorides, bromides and
  iodides. Release 3.0.1 is an immutable bibliographic-only patch over the
  3.0.0 scientific parent. A disclosed Record 13 structure-dimensionality
  mapping erratum affects four structure-grain cells but does not alter release
  counts, space-group denominators or polar subsets. The public website/API
  exposes explicit effective correction fields pending scientific hotfix
  3.0.2. Coverage and candidate metadata remain isolated from the frozen
  release until primary article, SI and/or CIF review is complete.
keywords:
  - copper(I) halide
  - Cu(I)-I
  - copper iodide
  - crystallography
  - luminescence
  - self-trapped exciton
  - scientific database
  - retrieval-augmented generation
